<title>INDIA: India's IOC gets new acting chairman.</title>
<headline>India's IOC gets new acting chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>M.A. Pathan assumed charge as acting chairman of the state-run Indian Oil Corporation (IOC), a company statement said on Friday.</p>
<p>Pathan took over from R.K. Narang, who retired after 32 years of service with the corporation, it added.</p>
